commit 929d6d8c1347df5d936c36ff9a8078b20a87474f
Author:     R51 Evidence <r51@example.invalid>
AuthorDate: Thu Aug 20 20:19:07 2026 +0800
Commit:     R51 Evidence <r51@example.invalid>
CommitDate: Thu Aug 20 20:19:07 2026 +0800

    [Layer B] libc++abi: expose GNU forced-unwind marker type
    
    GNU C++ code protects pthread cancellation with a handler for
    __cxxabiv1::__forced_unwind, but libc++abi does not expose or map that marker.
    Define the same abstract class shape used by libstdc++, with an out-of-line
    virtual destructor so libc++abi owns one exported strong typeinfo definition.
    Map a forced foreign exception to this type during personality matching.
    
    This extension depends on the Layer A forced-unwind rethrow and ARM EHABI
    handler fixes, at least on armv7l, because the matched handler rethrows the
    foreign exception.  Validation covers x86_64 native and armv7l hardware with
    libgcc_s.  It does not cover aarch64, LLVM libunwind, concurrent cancellation,
    or mixed-runtime frame traversal.
    
    中文说明：移植 GNU 强制展开标记类型及 personality 映射；采用抽象类
    和库内 key function，保证消费者引用 libc++abi 中唯一的强 typeinfo。
    该扩展在 armv7l 上依赖层 A。

commit d521a7195c0094adf926ff403fba53386cced66c
Author:     R51 Evidence <r51@example.invalid>
AuthorDate: Thu Aug 20 20:18:39 2026 +0800
Commit:     R51 Evidence <r51@example.invalid>
CommitDate: Thu Aug 20 20:18:39 2026 +0800

    [Layer A] libc++abi: preserve foreign forced-unwind state
    
    A foreign exception rethrown through __cxa_rethrow currently starts a new
    unwind with _Unwind_RaiseException.  For pthread cancellation this loses the
    forced-unwind continuation.  Use _Unwind_Resume_or_Rethrow for foreign
    exceptions while retaining the existing native and SJLJ paths.
    
    On ARM EHABI, the resumed forced unwind may reach a catching handler during
    the cleanup phase.  Treat a non-zero ttypeIndex as a catching handler and do
    not register it through __cxa_begin_cleanup, matching libstdc++'s
    found_cleanup gate.
    
    The two changes form one series: applying only the rethrow change exposes the
    EHABI cleanup-registration defect on ARM.  Validation covers x86_64 native
    and armv7l hardware with libgcc_s.  It does not cover aarch64, LLVM libunwind,
    or mixed-runtime frame traversal.
    
    中文说明：修复外来强制展开重抛状态丢失，并修复 ARM EHABI 将捕获
    handler 误登记为 cleanup 的问题。两处必须作为同一系列应用。

